  "prefLabel": "Pod 103.01 Composition of the Board",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-05-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pod 103.01 Composition of the Board. The board consists of 5 members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 315:1. The board is made up of 4 licensed podiatrists and one member who is a representative of the general public and is unconnected with the podiatry profession.\n\nSource. #5391, eff 5-8-92, EXPIRED: 5-8-98\n\nNew. #7816, eff 1-7-03; ss by #14372, eff 9-19-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pod100-500.html"
